# ID_SENTENCE | IS_DISTINCT | MAX_NUM_COL | ID_SENT_TYPE | ID_GROUP_OBJECTS | OWNER_FLAG | OWNERSHIP | USABILITY | FILTER | FILTER_GROUP | APISQL
SAR_REAL_TIME_PER_ROLE | 0 | 0 | 1 |  | 80 |  |  | #I <= ? And #I >= ? And #I = '1' |  | SELECT @SCO_ID_INC_GROUP = B.SCO_ID_INC_GROUP FROM &SCO_REAL_TIME_ROLE A, SCO_INCIDENCE B WHERE A.ID_ORGANIZATION = B.ID_ORGANIZATION(+) AND A.SCO_ID_INCIDENCE = B.SCO_ID_INCIDENCE(+) AND (A.SCO_DT_START <= @SAR_DT_ALLOC_END And A.SCO_DT_START >= @SAR_DT_ALLOC_START And A.SCO_CK_IN_PAYROLL = '1')
